# Build context is the repo root (see docker-compose.yml) so the image can
# COPY dbt/ and quality/ requirements. Keep everything else out of the context -
# secrets above all, then the bulky generated dirs that would slow every build.
.env
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
airflow/logs
airflow/staging
dbt/target
dbt/logs
docs
notebooks
